   $q$Listen. Snakes are not as scary as many people think. Most kinds of snakes are not dangerous to people. Many snakes eat mice and rats that get into barns and sheds. Most snakes would rather slide away than bother a person. If you leave a snake alone, it will usually leave you alone, too. Which is NOT a reason the author gives? Tap the words.$q$, $q$[{"text":"They slide away.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They slide away."}},{"text":"They are long.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They are long."}},{"text":"They eat mice.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They eat mice."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They are long.$q$, $q$Many snakes are long, but that is not a reason the author gives. The reasons are that most snakes are not dangerous, many eat mice, and most slide away from people.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
