   $q$Listen. Fruit makes a great snack. Fruit is sweet, so it tastes like a treat. An apple or a banana is easy to pack in a lunch bag. Fruit has water and vitamins that help your body grow and stay healthy. You can eat many kinds of fruit, like grapes, pears, and oranges. Which is NOT a reason the author gives? Tap the words.$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is cheap.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"It is cheap."}},{"text":"It is sweet.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"It is sweet."}},{"text":"It is easy to pack.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"It is easy to pack."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It is cheap.$q$, $q$The author never talks about how much fruit costs. The reasons given are that fruit is sweet, easy to pack, and has water and vitamins.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
