  ('647d5ce3-5ade-5c8d-bc5f-7b54bf27a624', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g2-argument-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Listen. Planes are the fastest way to take a long trip. A plane can cross the whole country in just a few hours. Boats are the best way to see sea animals. From a boat, you might see dolphins jump or a whale spray water into the air. Some boats have a glass bottom so you can see fish. The author says you might see dolphins jump. Which point does that reason support? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"planes","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"plane","count":1}},{"text":"trains","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"train","count":1}},{"text":"boats","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"boat","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$boats$q$, $q$Seeing dolphins jump is a reason that boats are the best way to see sea animals. Crossing the country fast is a reason about planes.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
