   $q$Listen. School should start a little later in the morning. Many kids feel sleepy early in the day. Kids who get more sleep often pay better attention in class. A later start could also give families time to eat breakfast together. Then kids would come to school calm and ready to learn. Which is NOT a reason the author gives? Tap the words.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Time for breakfast.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Time for breakfast."}},{"text":"Buses are late.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Buses are late."}},{"text":"Kids pay attention.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Kids pay attention."}},{"text":"Kids are sleepy.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Kids are sleepy."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Buses are late.$q$, $q$The author never talks about buses. The reasons are that many kids are sleepy early, rested kids pay better attention, and families get time for breakfast.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
